# Project Rules

**Read and follow [`PROJECT_RULES.md`](../../PROJECT_RULES.md)** at the start of MVP work.

Also read before implementing:

- [`docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`](../../docs/ARCHITECTURE.md) — what to build
- [`docs/SLICES_PLAN.md`](../../docs/SLICES_PLAN.md) — slice status & TDD workflow

Quick enforcers:

- MVP phase — never import from `poc.tsx`
- Slice: `IN PROGRESS` + test plan before code; `DONE` only when tests green
- Layers: `app/` → `stores/` → `services/` — no native calls from screens
- `MemoryManager` owns Whisper/LLM exclusivity
- No PHI in logs; paywall at navigation layer
- iOS + Android only; web is dev UI testing

File-scoped detail: `ai-pipeline.mdc`, `typescript-standards.mdc`, `react-native-ui.mdc`, `navigation.mdc`.

Skills (memory/R8 + legacy POC only): `.ai/skills/` — model memory always defers to `ai-pipeline.mdc`. Canonical docs: `ARCHITECTURE.md`, `SLICES_PLAN.md`, `PROJECT_RULES.md`.
